          "canonical_heading": "POSSIBLE COMPLICATIONS",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Chemotherapy may cause leukopenia or thrombocytopenia, anorexia, alopecia, hemorrhagic cystitis, and/or pancreatitis.",
